{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-vs-relational","title":"图与关系模型对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/foundations/graph-vs-relational","wordCount":1556,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"图与关系模型对比\">图与关系模型对比</h1><p>「图数据库比关系库快」是一句被反复传播、又经常被误用的话。它在某些查询上快几个数量级，在另一些查询上反而更慢——关键全在查询的形状。要在真实项目里做出靠谱选型，不能停留在口号，得把两种模型放进同一个具体问题里，量化它们各自的代价曲线，看清交叉点在哪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>关系模型与图模型不是「新旧之争」，而是为不同问题优化的两种数据组织方式。关系模型把数据组织成规整的二维表，靠主键-外键在查询时动态建立联系；图模型把联系预先物化成边，靠指针游走在查询时直接复用。前者为集合运算与聚合优化，后者为路径遍历与连通性优化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[查询类型] --&gt; B[集合/聚合类]&#10;  A --&gt; C[路径/连通类]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[关系库占优&lt;br/&gt;列存/索引/向量化]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[图库占优&lt;br/&gt;免索引邻接]&#10;  A --&gt; D[关系深度]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[浅层1-2跳: 接近]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[深层3跳以上: 图库拉开差距]\">graph TD\n  A[查询类型] --&gt; B[集合/聚合类]\n  A --&gt; C[路径/连通类]\n  B --&gt; B1[关系库占优&lt;br/&gt;列存/索引/向量化]\n  C --&gt; C1[图库占优&lt;br/&gt;免索引邻接]\n  A --&gt; D[关系深度]\n  D --&gt; D1[浅层1-2跳: 接近]\n  D --&gt; D2[深层3跳以上: 图库拉开差距]</pre><p>把两者的根本差异先列成一张表，后续小节逐项落地：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>关系模型</th>\n<th>图模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据组织</td>\n<td>二维表 + 行</td>\n<td>节点 + 边</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联系的实现</td>\n<td>外键，查询时 JOIN</td>\n<td>物化边，直接寻址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema</td>\n<td>强约束、预先定义</td>\n<td>灵活、可渐进演化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度遍历代价</td>\n<td>随深度近似指数增长</td>\n<td>随结果规模线性增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合/统计</td>\n<td>强（向量化、列存）</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准查询语言</td>\n<td>SQL（统一成熟）</td>\n<td>Cypher/Gremlin/GQL（2024 起有 ISO 标准）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"join-的代价-为什么深度是分水岭\">JOIN 的代价：为什么深度是分水岭</h2><p>关系库实现「关系」靠的是 JOIN，而 JOIN 的代价正是两种模型分道扬镳的根本原因。考虑一个查「三度人脉」的需求：找出「我的朋友的朋友的朋友」。</p>\n<p>在关系库里，朋友关系存在一张 <code>friendship(user_a, user_b)</code> 表。三度查询需要把这张表自连接三次。即便每次 JOIN 都有索引支撑（每次查找约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），中间结果集的规模会随每一跳的平均度数相乘而膨胀：若平均每人有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 个朋友，三跳的中间结果近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 行，每一行还要再触发下一轮索引查找。随着深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 增加，总代价大致正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^k \\cdot \\log n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，对深度呈指数级敏感。</p>\n<p>在图库里，同样的查询从「我」这个节点出发，沿物化的边逐层展开。每条边都是直接引用，访问开销是常数；总代价正比于实际遍历到的边数，约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(d^k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但去掉了关系库里那个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的索引查找因子，更重要的是去掉了反复重建联系的开销。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（用户总数）很大、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（深度）大于二三跳时，两条曲线就交叉了——这正是「图数据库快」这句话成立的精确区间。该优势的底层机制，见 <a href=\"../internals/graph-storage-engines\">图存储引擎与免索引邻接</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"schema-刚性约束-vs-渐进演化\">Schema：刚性约束 vs 渐进演化</h2><p>性能之外，第二个常被低估的差异是 schema 的刚柔。关系模型要求预先定义好表结构，每一列的类型、每一处约束都得提前想清楚；一旦业务要新增一种关系类型，往往意味着 <code>ALTER TABLE</code>、数据迁移、甚至重构应用层——在大表上这可能是高风险操作。</p>\n<p>图模型则天然支持渐进式演化：要表达一种全新的联系，只需开始往图里加一种新类型的边即可，不影响任何已有的节点和边；要给某类实体补一个属性，直接挂上去，没有这个属性的旧节点也不会报错。这种灵活性在领域模型尚未稳定、需求快速变化的早期项目里价值极大。当然，灵活是双刃剑——缺乏强约束也意味着数据质量更依赖应用层与建模纪律，关于如何在灵活中保持秩序，见 <a href=\"../modeling/graph-modeling\">图建模</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同一查询的两种写法\">同一查询的两种写法</h2><p>抽象的代价分析不如代码直观。看「找出 Alice 的三度人脉」这个需求在两种语言里的样子。</p>\n<p>关系库（SQL，三次自连接）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT DISTINCT f3.user_b&#10;FROM friendship f1&#10;JOIN friendship f2 ON f1.user_b = f2.user_a&#10;JOIN friendship f3 ON f2.user_b = f3.user_a&#10;WHERE f1.user_a = :alice_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> friendship f1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> friendship f2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> friendship f3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :alice_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>图库（Cypher，一行可变长路径）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"MATCH (a:Person {name:&#39;Alice&#39;})-[:FRIEND*3]-&gt;(fof)&#10;RETURN DISTINCT fof\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (a:Person {name:'Alice'})-[:FRIEND*3]->(fof)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN DISTINCT fof</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两点差异一目了然：其一，深度增加时 SQL 要手写更多 JOIN，而 Cypher 只改一个数字（<code>*3</code> 改成 <code>*1..6</code> 还能表达「一到六度内任意可达」）；其二，Cypher 的表达直接对应人脑里「沿关系走三步」的直觉。查询语言层面的对比将在 <a href=\"../modeling/cypher-gremlin-gql\">查询语言：Cypher、Gremlin 与 GQL</a> 深入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型决策-不是二选一\">选型决策：不是二选一</h2><p>把以上拼起来，选型其实有清晰的决策逻辑，而且答案常常不是「二选一」。如果你的核心负载是事务处理与报表聚合、关系浅且稳定，关系库依然是最稳妥的默认。如果你的核心负载是深度遍历、连通性分析、关系结构频繁演化，图库会带来质变。</p>\n<p>而现实中最常见、也最健康的选择是混合架构：让关系库或数仓承载它擅长的事务与聚合，让图库专门承载关系密集的子问题，两边通过 ETL 或 CDC 同步。判断「我的问题到底是不是图形状」的更完整启发式，见 <a href=\"why-graph-databases\">为何使用图数据库</a>；而要把图形状的问题真正落地为高效系统，则要理解 <a href=\"../internals/\">内部机制</a> 那一章讲的存储、执行与索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>关系模型与图模型是为不同问题优化的两种组织方式，不是新旧替代关系。</li>\n<li>JOIN 的代价对深度呈指数级敏感，约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^k \\cdot \\log n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>；图遍历约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(d^k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且无索引查找因子——深度大、数据多时图库拉开差距。</li>\n<li>Schema 上关系库刚性、需迁移，图库支持渐进演化、加边即可，但灵活也意味着更依赖建模纪律。</li>\n<li>同一三度人脉查询，SQL 需多次自连接、深度难调；Cypher 一行可变长路径、深度只改一个数字。</li>\n<li>选型回到查询形状：聚合/事务/浅关系选关系库，深度遍历/连通性/演化关系选图库。</li>\n<li>最优解常是混合架构，让两种模型各承载它擅长的子问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图与关系模型对比","id":"图与关系模型对比"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"JOIN 的代价：为什么深度是分水岭","id":"join-的代价-为什么深度是分水岭"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema：刚性约束 vs 渐进演化","id":"schema-刚性约束-vs-渐进演化"},{"level":2,"text":"同一查询的两种写法","id":"同一查询的两种写法"},{"level":2,"text":"选型决策：不是二选一","id":"选型决策-不是二选一"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"为何使用图数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/foundations/why-graph-databases"},"next":{"title":"图建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/modeling/graph-modeling"}}